  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Sector Reform and Strengthening         Initiative (FIRST) II - FIRST II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Financial Sector Reform and Strengthening         Initiative (FIRST) II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is given as a special Africa &quot;window&quot; within the    global FIRST framework. FIRST is a Trust Fund currently operating     with World Bank as a base. Small, urgent and catalytic interventions  are managed in response to financial sector vulnerabilities           (primarily identified via the WB/IMF FSAP toolkit). As such, FIRST    complement longer term bilateral work for financial stability.</narrative>
